        <div class="application-image thumbnail"  data-dest="https://sourceforge.net/software/link?oaparams=2__bannerid=80267__zoneid=77664__cb=e293dc7d0a__oadest=https%3A%2F%2Ftractian.com%2F%3Futm_source%3Dsourceforge%26utm_medium%3Dpaid%26utm_campaign%3Dsourceforgelisting%26utm_term%3Dvisitwebsitebutton" data-newtab="true" data-target="_blank" rel="nofollow">
            <img class="main-image" src="//a.fsdn.com/con/app/nel_img/19593" alt="Your Industrial Copilot for Maintenance and Reliability Icon">
            
        </div>
        <div class="wrapper">
            <div class="heading">
                <div class="heading-main">
                    
                    <span data-dest="https://sourceforge.net/software/link?oaparams=2__bannerid=80267__zoneid=77664__cb=e293dc7d0a__oadest=https%3A%2F%2Ftractian.com%2F%3Futm_source%3Dsourceforge%26utm_medium%3Dpaid%26utm_campaign%3Dsourceforgelisting%26utm_term%3Dvisitwebsitebutton" data-newtab="true" data-target="_blank" rel="nofollow" title="Find out more about Your Industrial Copilot for Maintenance and Reliability">Your Industrial Copilot for Maintenance and Reliability</span>

                    
                    <p class="teaser">For organizations looking for a Condition Monitoring and Asset Management solution to avoid machine failures</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            
            

            <div class="tiles">
                <div class="tile">
                    
                    <div class="description ">
                        <div class="description-inner">
                            Trusted by global brands such as Bosch, Kraft Heinz, Carrier, Hyundai, Johnson Controls, and P&amp;G, Tractian combines condition monitoring, energy efficiency, and a CMMS into a comprehensive, mobile-first solution. With Tractian, you can:
                        </div>
